<title>SINGAPORE: Kian Ho 1996 net profit up 10 pct.</title>
<headline>Kian Ho 1996 net profit up 10 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to 31 December 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   5.11    vs    4.65</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)		     6.00    vs    6.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		  3.93    vs    4.43</p>
<p>    Turnover			    70.77    vs   68.84</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest    0.13    vs    0.58</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		 1.51    vs    1.48</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	   0.89    vs    0.68</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     6.94    vs    6.69</p>
<p>    Tax				    1.88    vs    2.08</p>
<p>    Tax				    1.88    vs    2.08</p>
<p>    Minorities			   0.05    vs    0.05</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Kian Ho Bearings Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
